Scene Concept:
A panoramic, cinematic 2:1 horizontal artwork showing Earth viewed from low orbit, tilted to reveal both Asia and North America.
The continents glow softly beneath a thin layer of atmosphere, surrounded by subtle clouds and dynamic auroras near the poles.
Five luminous cargo hubs — Hong Kong (HKG), Memphis (MEM), Shanghai Pudong (PVG), Anchorage (ANC), and Incheon (ICN) — appear as radiant nodes connected by glowing energy flight paths.
Each airport is represented by a stylized miniature 3D terminal integrated seamlessly into the surface of the planet, surrounded by glowing runways, cargo containers, and light reflections, representing the unstoppable flow of goods and data around the world.
No text — only pure visuals.

